Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead, waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you\Nas you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that wind to dry all the tears as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're blaming the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure,\Nfound in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this my chop-chop emergency escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Unwrapped like that should\Nbreak your skull just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one here is my\Naerial tailspin, Dadan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked the wrong clown\Nto mess with, monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, no clutching!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you got a lot stronger,\Ndidn't you, kid? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Gorillas, they're called.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Blue Carrot for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But stay shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be four more of them\Nleft to take the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you got them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I hope\Nthat's the last of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nmess around right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here to let us out, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be your best friend, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong you bet\Nthere is. I thought you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,said only one prisoner\Nescaped yeah it was just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the clown guy pretty\Nsure i saw two guys but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm crazy. And speaking\Nof crazy, five blue got
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,taken down in front of\Ncommunity cell number 10
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,on level one there's no\Nway the prisoners down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,there aren't strong\Nenough to take on even one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Goldie, you're broken.\NHere to rescue me, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we gotta stay quiet i'm\Nnot really following
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,your own advice there we\Ncould well use the keys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to our cell if you're\Nnot too busy shut the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hell up nobody gives a\Ndamn wait do you know ace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah and though i can see the resemblance\Nhe made a better impression than you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After he woke up, we had a few drinks,\Nchatted it up, and became pretty good pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I think it sucks your\Nbrother got thrown in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of stupid of the Navy to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Whitebeard will give him hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they're keeping Ace on level 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you show me the way to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do you think I'm your friend now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you can die\Ndown here for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to break out of\Nhere, I'll just do it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but there's ten\Nbattleships out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've got a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be expecting an\Nattack from Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I picked a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could just lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find someone else then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we getting the key or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I must be imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What would he be doing\Nwith something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck with your escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding, because you\Nwon't stop yelling so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, that's a lovely armlet\Nyou've got there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can give\Nit to me, pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was a gift from Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let me have the armlet,\NI'll tell you how to get to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That a promise? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fork it over, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, let's shake those guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab onto my feet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, now start running!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful with those!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't have you chop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's review how Buggy's\Nchop-chop power works, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When he chop-chops his body to pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,he can control each part however he\Nlikes, but only within a limited area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if his feet aren't\Nclose to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he becomes unable to levitate\Nthe rest of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am one lucky clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain. Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just starting to have second\Nthoughts about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this is the cave where\NCaptain John kept his hidden treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And the crew he left behind\Nnever found it this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems a bit too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold the lantern and\Nkeep walking. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look alive, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure is near, but\Nso is unspeakable danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let your guard down, even for a\Nsecond, then death will creep up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what\Nkind of monsters will appear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,or what vicious booby\Ntraps await to kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Another fine day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Carving out tunnels awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you three must be the new guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like working up\Na sweat, right, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All a man really needs is a pickaxe\Nin his hand and a tunnel to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of our good\Nold-fashioned elbow grease,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone who comes to\Nthis tunnel will smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's liberating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, after all this, hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But we ought to hit it with\Nthe old bilge barge for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you make me work\Nlike one of your lackeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that wasn't the first dead\Nend we hit, and it wouldn't be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran all over the Grand Line\Nlooking for that treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As if that wasn't crappy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,my ill-fated treasure hunts brought\Nme straight to a navy post one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and the bastards threw me in\Nthis dump when they captured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe it was destiny all along,\Nguiding me to Captain John's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it, stride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard times are wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me and we'll be\Nat level two in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Level two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I wanted to go to level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how numbers work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go through two to\Nget to five. Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of this as an upside-down tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The place we're in right now is called level\None, which is the first basement floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, you go to level\Ntwo and level three and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The deeper you get, the more\Ninfamous the criminals are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They tortured me in the fires\Nof level four a few times,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's as far as I've gone myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else is just things\NI've heard from other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Level five is where they take\Nall the big shots, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So in a bounty as high as your\Nbrother's, he's gotta be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As for what's below level 5,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I've heard some rumors,\Nbut the details are scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The theory is the criminals\Nthey send down there are so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous that they've been\Ncompletely wiped from history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance that's\Nwhere they took your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the furthest I can take you is level\N4, so you're on your own after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a real\Njerk, but I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that armor leads me\Nto Captain John's treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a real bargain, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have opened my big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got caught, you're\Na pretty crappy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The idiot didn't even hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky he's so stupid.\NThat's awesomeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a treasure map?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet that'll be really fun. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid, but if you know the\Ntruth, I'll have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You better take this now\Nin case I forget later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that's a treasure map, and\Nyou're still gonna give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure's cool and all, but Ace is more\Nimportant But if you give it to me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what's to stop me from running off with\Nit and leaving you down here to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I guess, but you\Ngave your word you'd help out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's good enough for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those drastic eyes pouring into my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermit Skelgril's straw\Nhat, can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally have the key to Captain\NJohn's secret, and I own all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now how do I ditch you and\Nget the hell out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if we break through the walls\Nhere, is it like a shortcut?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That clown is bugging\Nthe escaped prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is that other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, this is the guard room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep going this way, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For crap's sake, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's a forest in the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is everything all red?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those guys down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're prisoners, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This so-called forest\Nis a torture chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every leaf is as sharp as a razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they call them blade trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And the grass is made of spikes\Nthat creak you like needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called spike needle grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Original, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The jailers release\Nvenomous spiders and chase
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the prisoners up and down\Nthe forest all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly pitchforks behind them,\Npiercing needles beneath them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and cutting razors everywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They run until they're\Ndrenched in their own blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,suffering agonies they\Nnever thought possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is level one, otherwise known as the\NCrimson Hell, the true face of Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I suffered enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place really is like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they doing this kind\Nof stuff to Ace, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep falling. That's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take my feet and throw them\Ndown on the ground right below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, you don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And the good news is, we don't need to go\Ndown any stairs to get to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No stairs, no gate, no\Nkey, just free-falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The normal prisoners\Nwouldn't want to take it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is one way to\Nget out of the Crimson
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hill that'll be perfect\Nfor our little plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See, we're already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, there's a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody wants to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not because it's dark and scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because this hole is a\None-way trip down to level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you think things are bad here,\Nwell, you ain't seen nothing yet, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When people get sent to hell, you better\Nbelieve they'll try to claw their way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one in their right mind would ever\Ndream of diving further into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a good thing we're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So just jump down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but be careful, there's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, would you give it a minute, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You got huge balls or just a tiny brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this works out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can blow this joint and\Nhe can't say a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the key to the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I got that chump off my\Nback and soon I'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say see you in hell, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been there and done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I robbed you, got my revenge,\Nand you thanks me for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid you can't chop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think the\Nchop-chop fruit is for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Surveillance troop, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We sighted another escapee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Buggy both fell to level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The beasts seem kind of restless today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they're not\Nhungry, anything but that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired to be afraid\Nanymore, I don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be there at\Ndinner sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it might as well be today, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a wild beast of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's gonna eat us whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to go to level\Ntwo in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to escape\Nand leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that sucks in\Nmy life is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this thing chasing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, I'd say it's the\Nrarest kind of monster in existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake born from a chicken egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A basilisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing came out of a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it was a monster, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,These things shouldn't be allowed\Nto live, let alone run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They eat people like snacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so they lock them up here where\Nthey can only eat criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this, Snakebird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting hot. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,as the Vice Warden told you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the Warden's office is located on Level 4,\Nwhich is known as the Burning Heat Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from his office, the\Nwhole floor is an inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There, we finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this Warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan suffers from\Nterrible digestive problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so he stays in the bathroom\Nan average of ten hours a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,seven days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he sleeps about\Neight hours each night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So once you factor in mealtimes and breaks,\Nhe only works about four hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really enough time to do his job?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When the need arises, he's the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're in luck, sounds\Nlike he's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I forgot to mention it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but the warden ate the venom\Nvenom fruit, so he's a poison man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work in there, warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed those bowels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's boss, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As always, it was a rough battle in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Magellan, the warden here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this room is too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record, I much prefer places\Nthat are dark, cold, and closed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being ridiculous. Now listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Momonga and the warlord Boa\NHancock are here on important business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And our time is short, Warden Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad case of the runs, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison soup I had for breakfast this\Nmorning isn't quite agreeing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a poison man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I love poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the old saying goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison kills poison, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's why you\Nhave venomous diarrhea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'm afraid that you\Nhave a venomous tongue, Hannibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and retire so\NI can become Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass, I mean, uh, please hurry\Nand show our guest a fire fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, like that\Nwas a slip of the tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It saddens my heart to know that\Nmy calling thinks so little of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden, please be careful when you exhale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your breath is poisonous gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell is so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Vice Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have the venomous tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare breathe your disgusting\Npoison in the face of an empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's stepping on me,\Nand I think I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden, you realize that's\Nthe warden's seat you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be mine soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the warden's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't answer my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm dying. Damn it,\NI just wanted to be warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,retrieve an antidote for\Nthe vice warden right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that you say? Someone\Nbroke into the prison. Absurd
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this is impelled down no\None has ever Infiltrated its
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,walls our defenses are\Nflawless how could we possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,allow this it is indeed A\Ntravesty and it was on your watch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,warden have they found\Nus out transfer the video
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.10,0:21:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,footage To my chambers warden\Ni was wondering would it be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,possible to see the prisoner\Nnow sure let's go Like right
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,now warden wake up we kind\Nof need you to deal with this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's odd it appears that\Nwe've lost contact with warden
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,magellan i want to report on\Nevery Level of this place sent
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,to the jailer's room and navy\Nheadquarters now i don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,why he's here And i have no\Nclue what he might be up to but
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that guy who's wreaking so\Nmuch havoc with buggy the Clown
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,on level two is definitely straw\Nhat luffy something's up we
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,lost contact with the jailer's\NRoom on level two what jailer's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,room on level two what's going\Non down there what's wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:22:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in the hell are you so small?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I used their gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Takes care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go! I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock, let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The god of salvation\Nhas descended into hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat the basilisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They destroyed the jailers' room, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be angels sent from heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you\Ntwo are, but thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, could you\Nhand us those keys, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for these cuffs in the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.62,0:22:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be saving my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in a cell nor\Nin a prison uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and it looks like he's on his\Nway out of here! All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,an opportunity like this one simply\Nwon't happen again, it's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I thought otherwise, it seems\Nheaven hasn't forsaken me just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us out of here! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is that any way to\Nask someone for a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One set of keys coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Compliments of Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept it with gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free! You're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the glorious name of the man\Nwho has given you your sweet freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Captain Buggy and\Nwe're in your debt forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,anybody talking bad about\NBuggy's gonna answer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.04,0:23:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to us that's me and don't\Nyou scum ever forget
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it now unlock the other\Ncells set everyone free
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,once these morons start\Nmaking havoc on this place
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finally have a chance\Nto sneak out on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,hey what the hell are you doing\Nthose guys are my turn put me down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.34,0:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid. Leave me down to the next\Nlevel last time or something how
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,should I know this place is like\Na maze you expect me to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the details of every floor\Nfive-year-old damn way to level three
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can smell freedom already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.90,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd leave me all the way down\Nto level four, and now you're gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted the treasure,\Nso I lied to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.48,0:24:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With all those prisoners free,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.12,0:24:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the chaos will be immeasurable\NAnd when that happens, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.04,0:25:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that? You lied? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you idiots doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.76,0:25:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to race\Nhell and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We, uh, we just remembered\Nwhy we never tried to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape is impossible, especially with\Nthose wild beasts running around!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.86,0:25:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dying is for the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.78,0:25:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're way better off in this set.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've changed my mind, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.14,0:25:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the way to level three here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.42,0:25:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.84,0:25:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you just said you didn't\Nknow the way, Big Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is perfect. How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.10,0:25:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but overhear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're having trouble\Non this floor, I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.54,0:25:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me out without\Nnoticing. How fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a man who always pays back his debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.26,0:25:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's the three hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just a little\Ngame of hide and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.92,0:26:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on the island\Nwith the giants, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Three. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.50,0:26:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.28,0:26:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That violent oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.10,0:26:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Captain. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.66,0:26:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart, however, craves justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.12,0:26:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart wants war!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here and not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.06,0:27:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with my title as a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.94,0:27:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.84,0:27:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means that I could stop this fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.54,0:27:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I would happily lay down my own life.
